{"root":{"data":{"id":"djdkhgx8fzk0","created":1781927230974,"text":"建设社会主义生态文明"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djdkjezodvc0","created":1781927383496,"text":"坚持人与自然和谐共生"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djdkjljvny00","created":1781927397779,"text":"生态兴则文明兴"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djdkjp2kwtc0","created":1781927405440,"text":"  - 自然是生命之母， 人与自然是生命共同体"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djdkjp2ltug0","created":1781927405441,"text":"  - 生态环境变化直接影响文明的兴衰演替  "},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djdkjp2lll40","created":1781927405441,"text":"  - 生态文明是人类文明发展的历史趋势  "},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djdkjp2ltlk0","created":1781927405441,"text":"  - 绵延 5000 多年的中华文明孕育着丰富的生态文化"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"djdkjnk3mzc0","created":1781927402146,"text":"2. 绿水青山就是金山银山"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djdkjuglx3s0","created":1781927417172,"text":"  - 生态环境问题归根到底是经济发展方式和生活方式问题  "},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djdkjuglpk00","created":1781927417172,"text":"  - 表面上，生态环境保护和经济发展是矛盾对立的关系，是鱼和熊掌不可兼得的两难选择"},"children":[]}]}]}]},"template":"default","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}